# English Only

All project output must be in **English**:

- Documentation: `README.md`, `VERSION.md`, comments in rules, commit messages, PR descriptions
- Code: variable/function names, inline comments, user-facing strings in the plugin UI and toasts
- Changelogs and release notes

Do not write documentation, comments, or user-facing plugin text in other languages unless the user explicitly requests a translation.

When updating docs after a release, use English section headings (e.g. **Version Summary**, **Full Timeline**, **Changes** — not Indonesian equivalents).
